` holds; otherwise by `divMuW`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMuT","kind":"def","line":1534,"name":"MPN.NatOps.divMuT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L1534-L1544"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.truncOK\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">truncOK</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether Barrett's division by the reciprocal of the top `k + 1` limbs applies: at an even base,\n`k + 1 ≤ n`, a normalized `d`, a normalized `topD d n k` of `k + 1` limbs and the checks of\n`recipG`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.truncOK","kind":"def","line":1511,"name":"MPN.NatOps.truncOK","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barret