n `d μ ≤ B²ⁿ < d (μ + 5)` and `Bⁿ ≤ 2 d`, where `x - q d < 7 d`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.barrettW","kind":"def","line":978,"name":"MPN.NatOps.barrettW","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L978-L989"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">recipG_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hB</span> : <span class=\"fn\">8</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hB2</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.size\">size</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> →\n  <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.size\">size</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> →\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG\">recipG</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> →\n      <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG\">recipG</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.size\">size</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>         <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.size\">size</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG\">recipG</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">5</span>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG_spec","kind":"theorem","line":845,"name":"MPN.NatOps.recipG_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L845-L976"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">recipG</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reciprocal of the `n`-limb `d`, less one, by Newton's iteration as in `recip`, with every\nstep checked with its error term, and whether all the checks hold. Since the steps\nbelow are good, the error term `e = B^(n+h) - d μₕ` of each step is less than `Bⁿ⁺¹` either way\n(`newton_apriori`), so it is the residue of `B^(n+h) - d μₕ` modulo `B^N - 1` for\n`N = mulModSize (n + 2)`, read from either side: `d μₕ` is a wrapped product, `mulMod`, about the\ncost of an `n`-limb product instead of an `n` by `h` one.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recipG","kind":"def","line":812,"name":"MPN.NatOps.recipG","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L812-L843"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">divMu_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hd</span> : <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu\">divMu</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu\">divMu</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu_spec","kind":"theorem","line":742,"name":"MPN.NatOps.divMu_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L742-L754"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">divMu</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`(a / d, a % d)` by Barrett's division with Newton's reciprocal, for `d ≠ 0`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divMu","kind":"def","line":738,"name":"MPN.NatOps.divMu","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L738-L740"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recip\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">recip</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"An approximation of `B²ⁿ / d` for the `n`-limb `d`, by Newton's iteration: the reciprocal\n`μₕ` of the top `h = ⌈n / 2⌉ + 1` limbs, then one step from `μ₀ = μₕ Bᵏ`, `k = n - h`:\n`μ₀ + μ₀ (B²ⁿ - d μ₀) / B²ⁿ = μₕ Bᵏ + μₕ e / B²ⁿ⁻²ᵏ` with `e = B²ⁿ⁻ᵏ - d μₕ`, an `n` by `h`\nproduct. `e` is about `B²ⁿ⁻ᵏ⁻ʰ`, and only its limbs from `t = 2n - 2k - h - 2` on enter the\ncorrection, an `h` by `k` product. The step squares the relative error of `μ₀`, about `B⁻ʰ`, so\nthe error of the result is about `Bⁿ⁻²ʰ ≤ B⁻²` units: the extra limb of `h` keeps errors from\ngrowing from one level to the next. Four limbs and fewer by the slow division.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.recip","kind":"def","line":712,"name":"MPN.NatOps.recip","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Barrett.lean#L712-L736"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Barrett.html#MPN.NatOps.divBlocks_spec\"